    {
      "field_id": "F.quantitative_result",
      "value": "Spontaneous oscillation: 30±3% MT vs 18±2% WT (p=0.001); soma frequency 0.74±0.02/min MT vs 0.41±0.01/min WT (p<0.001); ATP-induced Ca2+ peak 4.60±0.07 MT vs 4.04±0.07 WT (p<0.001); mouse null oscillation 67±5% vs 47±6% WT (p=0.01), frequency 2.01±0.04/min vs 1.64±0.03/min (p<0.001); ATP amplitude 7.25±0.23 vs 6.54±0.12 (p=0.04); in situ frequency 0.59±0.01 vs 0.47±0.01/min (p<0.001), glutamate peak 2.75±0.02 vs 2.22±0.09 (p<0.001); in vivo soma frequency 2.15±0.11 vs 1.44±0.20/min (p=0.003); TG-induced ER release 125±4% MT vs 100±3% WT (p<0.001), leak time constant 54±1s MT vs 59±1s WT (p<0.001); baseline Rhod-2 154±7% GFP- vs 100±5% GFP+ (p<0.0001); SOCE 2.93±0.07 MT vs 2.41±0.06 WT (p<0.001); TRPC4 ~27 fold increase by RNA-seq, ~14 fold by microarray",
